                                        "entry_id": "86fc9895-ff2a-3aab-bad4-5c4c48f5ccbe",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pertaining to the ancient people of the Horn of Africa, historically considered the descendants of biblical Cush."
                                        ],
